      "widgets_values": [
        "Auto: Upright — straighten tilted horizons and converging verticals.\n\nauto makes building verticals parallel when it finds them, else levels the horizon. confidence 0 means the photo had too few straight lines and was left as is. Steep look-up shots are corrected up to max_angle (25 degrees). crop valid zooms in so no empty corners remain. Chain Auto Tone after it for a one-click base edit."
      ]
